== Description ==


This plugin is a floating ad plugin. You can place your ad at the top of your blog and it will stay there although you scroll the page. You can comment at <a href="http://smallwebsitehost.com/" target="_blank" title="Floating ad">here</a>. See the demo <a href="http://ourhappymoney.com">here</a>.

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Place <?php
		$floatad = new floatad ();
		$floatad->displayad(); ?> right after the <BODY> tag on your theme file. You could probably find it at 	header.php.
4. I've put my Powered By Smallwebsitehost.com link in the floatad. I would really appreciate it, if you leave it.